al styles, me/admin/index routes, or any seller files.\nNext: Wave 1 Task 5 (Build Seller UI Flow).","created_at":"2026-05-29T14:34:57Z"},{"id":"019e7433-8934-7cd7-af03-8cba77e3992f","issue_id":"zwapit-27t","author":"Harsha Nanda","text":"Wave 1 Task 5 (Build Seller UI Flow) complete on branch claude/zwapit-27t-wave1.\nCommit: 7c84f8e feat: build seller UI flow (Task 5).\nValidation: RED `bun scripts/ui-smoke-seller.mjs` failed before implementation. GREEN after implementation: ui-smoke-seller passed for 6 seller routes; ui-smoke-buyer still passes for 5 routes (no regression); `bun run build` exit 0 (15 pages); `bun run check` exit 0 (0 errors, 0 warnings, 11 hints); `bun run check:routes` passed for 15 contract routes; lefthook pre-commit typecheck passed.\nSpec: upload-first flow (Upload -\u003e Detected details -\u003e Set your price + Payout estimate -\u003e Seller promise -\u003e auto-approved result -\u003e Go to Orders). Seller Orders uses Orders (never Sales), shows transfer-needed + payout-waiting timeline states and mocked payout setup (Ready). Friendly copy only; smoke asserts absence of escrow/settlement/dispute/merchant/fulfilment/KYC/AMBER/Sales/Transactions across all 6 seller pages.\nDecisions: seller/format.ts re-exports buyer/format.ts formatters (cross-folder, both Claude-owned); sell/orders shows representative state transfer_pending, Task 9 binds to live state; payout setup is mock only (mock_ready -\u003e \"Ready (mock)\"); seller promise checkboxes pre-checked to stay consistent with the static auto-approved result panel.\nOwnership: only Task 5 files + new scripts/ui-smoke-seller.mjs. Did not edit package.json, configs, src/lib/**, AppShell/BottomNav/AppLayout, global styles, buyer/admin/me/index routes.\nWave 1 UI (Tasks 4 + 5) done. Note: bd comment written to local store only; .beads/issues.jsonl is untracked and unstaged (not Claude ownership) - needs forge/Codex beads sync to propagate.","created_at":"2026-05-29T14:46:35Z"},{"id":"019e77bc-faf7-7d84-88cc-7f077906018e","issue_id":"zwapit-27t","author":"Harsha Nanda","text":"Task 9 (Integrate Buyer/Seller UI With Local State) complete on branch claude/zwapit-27t-wave1.\nCommit: b4224bc feat: integrate buyer/seller UI with local state (Task 9).\nValidation (all fresh, GREEN): RED `bun scripts/e2e-buyer.mjs` + `bun scripts/e2e-seller.mjs` failed before src/lib/flow/mockFlow.ts existed. After integration: e2e-buyer pass (Home-\u003eListing-\u003eCheckout-\u003etimeline-\u003ecompleted), e2e-seller pass (validate-\u003eauto-approve-\u003etransfer-\u003epayout waiting-\u003ecompleted); ui-smoke-buyer 5 routes, ui-smoke-seller 6 routes (no regression); `bun test` 23 pass / 0 fail (Codex units intact); `bun run check` 0 errors/0 warnings/11 hints; `bun run build` 15 pages + client bundles emitted; `bun run check:routes` 15 routes; lefthook pre-commit typecheck passed.\nWhat was implemented: new integration layer src/lib/flow/mockFlow.ts (connectMockListingFlow, connectMockCheckoutFlow, connectSellerOrderFlow, connectTimelineActions, reportBuyerIssue + browser-guarded loadDemoState/saveDemoState) and src/lib/flow/timelinePanel.client.ts (interactive advance panel). Checkout Pay -\u003e validateCheckout + mockPay (checkout_pending -\u003e transfer_pending) -\u003e localStorage -\u003e My Tickets. Tickets/order/sell-orders advance the shared mock order via state helpers. Report issue wired to buyerReportIssue (reason code + evidence). Seller promise result now from the local rule engine (evaluateSourceRule) + validateSellerListing.\nDELIBERATE SCOPE INVERSION: Task 9 File(s) lists 5 Codex lib files (mock/listings.ts, mock/orders.ts, state/orderTransitions.ts, rules/evaluateRule.ts, validation/checkoutValidation.ts). Left them UNCHANGED (confirmed empty diff) to avoid breaking Codex's 23 unit tests; added src/lib/flow/* as the integration touchpoint instead. Task 4/5 components also untouched (wired via DOM queries).\nFindings to address in Task 10 / by Codex (NOT edited here): (1) Type/contract drift: MockIssue.reasonCode allows only ticket_not_transferred|ticket_invalid|wrong_ticket, but the contract lists 6 reasons and the ReportIssue UI offers all 6; reportIssue does no runtime validation so the demo works (cast used in orders page script). 'ticket_invalid' isn't a contract reason. (2) connectMockListingFlow is exercised via sell/promise + e2e but Home/Listing still read createMockFixture directly; the purchasability gate lives at checkout (validateCheckout), which is sufficient for the path.\nVerification limitation: interactive timeline advancement is verified at logic level (e2e smokes exercise the exact functions the client calls) and build-emit level (client bundles ship); NOT verified in-browser (no Playwright).\nMock-local only: localStorage; no auth/payment/Razorpay/Convex/admin/source. Note: e2e/ui smokes are not in package.json (run via bun scripts/...); pre-push runs typecheck only. bd comment is local-store only - .beads/issues.jsonl untracked, needs forge/Codex sync to propagate. Next: Task 10 (Acceptance) by Codex.","created_at":"2026-05-30T07:15:34Z"},{"id":"019e77e1-c954-7b3a-8693-0d1c2f0221c8","issue_id":"zwapit-27t","author":"Harsha Nanda","text":"Task 10 Acceptance Verification complete.\nCommit: 0c441123dc0d775b3e15488aee238d4d6e3d3e65 (test: add first visible slice acceptance verification).\nFiles: scripts/verify-first-visible-slice.mjs, tests/acceptance/firstVisibleSlice.test.ts, src/lib/types.ts.\nValidation: bun run check passed (0 errors, 0 warnings, 11 existing hints); bun run build passed (15 pages); bun run check:routes passed (15 contract routes); bun test passed (26 tests, 0 failures, 102 expects); bun scripts/verify-first-visible-slice.mjs passed; bun test tests/acceptance/firstVisibleSlice.test.ts passed (3 tests); bun scripts/e2e-buyer.mjs passed; bun scripts/e2e-seller.mjs passed; bun scripts/ui-smoke-buyer.mjs passed; bun scripts/ui-smoke-seller.mjs passed.\nManual browser smoke: served build with Astro preview and drove Chrome via DevTools; verified checkout Pay -\u003e My Tickets, timeline advancement to completed, and fresh active order Report issue capture.\nDecisions: MockIssue.reasonCode reconciled to the 6 contract reason codes; stale ticket_invalid removed from the type. Listing-page evaluator wiring was not required for acceptance because purchasability is verified through connectMockListingFlow and enforced at checkout by validateCheckout; verifier documents that gate location. package.json unchanged because shared-file approval was not requested; smoke scripts were run explicitly.\nReviews: spec compliance reviewer found no blocking issues; code quality/scope reviewer re-review found no blocking Task 10 issues after route href coverage and staged-scope checks were added.\nScope: mock-local only; no real auth, payment, payout, production admin, or production source integration added. Unrelated local changes .codex/config.toml and .mcp.json were excluded from the Task 10 commit.","created_at":"2026-05-30T07:55:46Z"},{"id":"019e77ed-2015-7c05-9ca7-863fa21e1567","issue_id":"zwapit-27t","author":"Harsha Nanda","text":"Stage: ship complete → ready for review\nSummary: PR #2 created for claude/zwapit-27t-wave1 to master after fresh validation and audit fix\nDecisions: Added focused yaml-language-server override to clear bun audit pr-coordinator merge-sim could not checkout master due unrelated dirty local files, so non-mutating git merge-tree origin/master HEAD was used and succeeded\nArtifacts: https://github.com/harshanandak/Zwapit/pull/2 branch claude/zwapit-27t-wave1 commits 0c44112 and afcdf82\nNext: Run review on PR #2 and address CI or reviewer feedback","created_at":"2026-05-30T08:08:09Z"},{"id":"019e77ed-588f-7e85-8116-d554eefbdee3","issue_id":"zwapit-27t","author":"Harsha Nanda","text":"PR created: https://github.com/harshanandak/Zwapit/pull/2\nBranch: claude/zwapit-27t-wave1 -\u003e master\nLatest commit: afcdf8241fb2e47fef9c0a8